WEBVTT

00:03:27.851 --> 00:03:33.500
Si ajabu wafanyikzi wengi
waligeukia ustahi wa wasomi.

00:03:34.506 --> 00:03:36.220
Tunafaa tufanye nini ?

00:03:36.609 --> 00:03:40.664
Tunafaa kuwazia kipengee tatu
cha uraia wetu.

00:03:41.331 --> 00:03:42.641
Nafasi ya chuo,

00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:44.244
usharifu wa kazi

00:03:44.268 --> 00:03:45.982
na maana ya ufanisi.

00:03:47.149 --> 00:03:51.297
Tunafaa kuwazia tena 
nafasi ya vyuo

00:03:51.321 --> 00:03:54.000
kama suluhishi la fursa.

00:03:55.583 --> 00:04:00.460
Kwa watu kama sisi 
tunaotangamana na wasomi,